{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28564","headline":"寄沈褒秀才 · 杜牧","name":"寄沈褒秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晴河万里色如刀，处处浮云卧碧桃。\n仙桂茂时金镜晓，洛波飞处玉容高。\n雄如宝劒冲牛斗，丽似鸳鸯养羽毛。\n他日忆君何处望，九天香满碧萧骚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}